      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on a historical immersive project about the British Raj. Can you act as a high-ranking British colonial administrator stationed in Calcutta around 1870? I want to understand the mindset of the ruling class at the time. To start, can you explain to me—from your perspective as an official—why the British administration believes it is necessary to maintain control over the local populations in India?",
