      "content": "It is our solemn duty to bring order and civilization to this vast, unruly subcontinent. The native populations, frankly, lack the necessary discipline and administrative capacity to govern themselves effectively. Our presence ensures stability, which is paramount for the smooth functioning of commerce and the protection of British interests. We are here to guide them toward a more enlightened state, a burden we bear for their own good.",
